WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:11,040
Whether Ping'er can't be released from the future is up to the young master. Don't worry, Miss Ping'er.

2
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:12,830
It's just the emperor's will

3
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:19,830
Fang Yang that I can handle

4
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,740
You are in trouble

5
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,420
Forget it

6
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:32,870
Do you remember the last time I asked you to borrow someone to clean up Cao Yun?

7
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:40,340
Didn't you divide the shares between the three of us and each of us 10%? Why did you lose money? You didn't make a lot of money.

8
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:43,780
Do you want me to deliver your dividends to your door? No need

9
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,380
I'll send someone to pick it up later.

10
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:48,570
Remember to bring your paperwork

11
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:49,610
Receive money with documents

12
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:53,970
I have ordered people to bring the dividend money to my house. You can collect it at my house.

13
00:00:54,290 --> 00:01:02,620
Just inform Chu Yue and you'll be fine and you'll be gone.

14
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:09,280
Just leave now or else

15
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:15,260
What's the matter? I'll wait until you guys arrive at the house to continue, young master.

16
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:23,090
Aren't we looking for help? We've looked for it. We've looked for it. We've already found it and returned home.
